msgid "Known issues {#known-issues}"
msgstr "Problèmes connus {#known-issues}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As long as the Qiskit C API has not yet reached feature parity with its Python API, some components of this package remain exclusive to its Python API, too. This includes the entire circuit library ([`qiskit_fermions.circuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit#module-qiskit_fermions.circuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit\")) as well as transpiler passes ([`qiskit_fermions.transpiler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler#module-qiskit_fermions.transpiler \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler\")).\n"
msgstr "Tant que l'API C de Qiskit n'a pas atteint la parité de fonctionnalités avec son API Python, certains composants de ce package restent également exclusifs à son API Python. Cela inclut toute la bibliothèque de circuits ([`qiskit_fermions.circuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit#module-qiskit_fermions.circuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit\")) ainsi que les passes de transpileur ([`qiskit_fermions.transpiler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler#module-qiskit_fermions.transpiler \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler\")).\n"

